%% Container-level sequence: SD-05 Simulated live replay with alerts (UC-06, UC-07; FR-12, FR-13, FR-14, FR-15)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor BM as Building Manager
  participant WEB as Web Dashboard<br/>(src/frontend)
  participant API as Backend API<br/>(api/replay.py, services/alert_service.py)
  participant DB as Energy Database<br/>(SQLite)
  participant MS as Model Artifact Store<br/>(models/)

  BM->>WEB: start replay (start time, speed x60, threshold 400 Wh)
  WEB->>API: POST /api/replay {start_ts, speed, threshold_wh}
  API->>DB: INSERT replay_sessions (status=running, cursor=start_ts)
  DB-->>API: session id
  API-->>WEB: 201 {session_id}

  loop every (600 s / speed) until finished or paused
    WEB->>API: GET /api/replay/{id}/next
    API->>DB: SELECT next measurement after cursor
    DB-->>API: reading
    API->>MS: cached model
    API->>API: predict next-step energy
    API->>DB: INSERT predictions (source=replay), UPDATE cursor
    alt predicted_wh or actual_wh > threshold
      API->>DB: INSERT alerts (value, threshold, timestamp)
      API-->>WEB: 200 {reading, predicted_wh, alert}
      WEB-->>BM: update live chart + show alert banner
    else normal
      API-->>WEB: 200 {reading, predicted_wh}
      WEB-->>BM: update live chart
    end
  end

  BM->>WEB: pause / stop
  WEB->>API: PATCH /api/replay/{id} {status}
  API->>DB: UPDATE replay_sessions status
  API-->>WEB: 200
